    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/eudpp#methodology_CML2002> ;
    skos:note "LCA methodology (EF 3.0/3.1, CML 2002, ReCiPe 2016, IPCC AR6, EN 15804 inventory rules). Proposed from the eudpp reverse-coverage run of 2026-10-30 to cover eudpp:methodology_CML2002."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch eudpp:methodology_CML2002 .

