oec:MethodologyEN15804InventoryRules
    a owl:NamedIndividual, oec:LCAMethodology ;
    rdfs:label "EN 15804+A2 inventory calculation rules"@en ;
    skos:notation "EN 15804+A2 inventory" ;
    rdfs:comment "Inventory calculation rules defined by EN 15804+A2 itself for the 18 resource-use / waste / output-flow inventory indicators (PERE, PERM, ... EEE, EET). This \"methodology\" is inventory-level rather than characterised; it is distinguished here from EF 3.1 because the inventory indicators do not use EF characterisation factors."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/common/core/> ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/eudpp#methodology_EN15804InventoryRules> ;
    skos:note "LCA methodology (EF 3.0/3.1, CML 2002, ReCiPe 2016, IPCC AR6, EN 15804 inventory rules). Proposed from the eudpp reverse-coverage run of 2026-10-30 to cover eudpp:methodology_EN15804InventoryRules."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch eudpp:methodology_EN15804InventoryRules .

